%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a></figure></div><p><strong>For more great content <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/taylorlorenz3.0/\">follow my meme page</a>, subscribe to <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/taylorlorenz\">my YouTube channel</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/channel/AbZQPs8zLytuVxvh/\">join my Instagram broadcast channel</a> where I share links all week long.</strong></p><p><strong>Listen to my podcast Power User on Apple Podcasts:</strong></p><div></div><p><strong>Or follow Power User on Spotify:</strong></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>","author":"Taylor Lorenz","siteTitle":"usermag.co","siteHash":"95f273abc07d53f60c12a9877d5e701fc5d46103659afbdcd53f0429eec6280d","entryHash":"ef68d325af341d27dee611df083101ccc408aa67fc66ad148b72bf923cac8eb6","category":"Sites"}